---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const host = Astro.request.headers.get('x-forwarded-host') || Astro.request.headers.get('host') || Astro.url.host;
const scheme = Astro.request.headers.get('x-forwarded-proto') === 'https' ? 'https:' : Astro.url.protocol;
const remote = `${scheme}//${host}/git/content.git`;
---
<Base title="账户">
  <div class="account-shell">
    <header class="page-heading"><h1>账户</h1><p id="account-status" role="status">正在读取账户…</p></header>
    <div id="account-content" hidden>
      <div class="account-identity"><div><strong id="account-name"></strong><span class="role-label" id="account-role"></span></div><button id="logout" class="button button-quiet" type="button">退出登录</button></div>
      <section class="settings-section" aria-labelledby="publishing-heading">
        <h2 id="publishing-heading">从本地发布文章</h2><p class="section-description">获得站长授权后，通过 HTTPS 克隆自己的文章仓库。Git 会提示输入网站用户名和密码；也可以通过系统凭据管理器保存。</p>
        <p id="publish-status" class="section-description"></p>
        <ol class="publishing-steps"><li><p>克隆个人仓库。同一个链接会按认证账号映射到各自独立的仓库。</p><pre><code>{`git clone ${remote} my-articles`}</code></pre></li><li><p>创建索引和正文，再提交推送。不要把密码写入仓库 URL。</p><pre><code>cd my-articles
# 创建 index.toml 和 posts/first/main.md
git add index.toml posts/first
git commit -m 'Publish article'
git push -u origin main</code></pre></li></ol>
        <details><summary>查看 index.toml 示例</summary><pre><code>{`[[articles]]\nid = "first"\nfolder = "posts/first"\ntitle = "第一篇文章"\ndescription = "文章简介"\ntags = ["随笔"]\npublic = true\n# entry = "main.md"`}</code></pre><p class="field-help">作者和时间由系统生成。入口默认 main.md，正文不需要 Frontmatter。</p></details>
      </section>
      <section class="settings-section" aria-labelledby="password-heading"><h2 id="password-heading">修改密码</h2><form id="password-form"><label for="old-password">原密码</label><input id="old-password" type="password" name="old_password" autocomplete="current-password" required maxlength="1024" /><label for="new-password">新密码</label><input id="new-password" type="password" name="new_password" autocomplete="new-password" required maxlength="1024" /><p class="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><button class="button button-quiet" type="submit">修改密码</button></form></section>
      <section id="admin-section" class="settings-section" aria-labelledby="admin-heading" hidden><h2 id="admin-heading">发布授权</h2><p class="section-description">公钥登记与发布授权分别检查。停用账户会同时撤销登录和发布权限。</p><p id="admin-status" class="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div id="admin-users" class="admin-users"></div><h3>暂存的索引</h3><div id="pending-indexes"></div></section>
    </div>
    <noscript><p class="notice">账户设置需要启用 JavaScript。</p></noscript>
  </div>
</Base>
